      "category": "transport",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "The Parkwood Neighborhood Association, an all‑volunteer group, keeps the town’s streets safe and connects residents with the City of Shoreline.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        6
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 2"
      ],
      "source": "https://www.destinationshoreline.com/neighborhoods/parkwood",
      "category": "people",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Interurban line stretched 29 miles with 30 stops, and Parkwood’s Pershing Station sat near 155th Street, a key junction for travelers.",
